     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Julia,<br><br></div>Here is a working solution with  notes on a few topics that are easy to overlook. Leaflet is a bit more complex than other outputs! :)<br><br><a href=\"https://github.com/Stephen-McDaniel/shiny-map-leaflet-filtering\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Stephen-McDaniel/shiny-map-leaflet-filtering&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390928992000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UargjkgYectMhiO3ctHpL\">https://github.com/Stephen-McDaniel/shiny-map-leaflet-filtering</a> <br><br><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/attach/146353f6b7b135/image.png?part=0.1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"Inline image 1\" style=\"margin-right:0px\" width=\"393\" height=\"434\"><br><br><div><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\">Best regards,<br><span lang=\"EN\">Stephen McDaniel</span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\"><span lang=\"EN\">Chief Data Scientist</span></span></div><div>PowerTrip Analytics</div><div>Automatic data, analytic &amp; visualization solutions in the cloud.</div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0)\"><a href=\"https://PowerTripAnalytics.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://PowerTripAnalytics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390928992000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0g15cT2w55XqwmJAxsDerL\">https://PowerTripAnalytics.com</a> <br></span></div><br><br></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
